flowchart LR
  User[Users] --> TLS[HTTPS reverse proxy]
  TLS --> Auth[Basic Auth]
  TLS --> Health[Public health endpoint]
  Auth --> Synod[Synod service]
  Secrets[Protected .env / secret manager] --> Synod
  Synod --> Data[(Persistent data)]
  Synod --> Providers[Model providers]
  Synod --> Anything[AnythingLLM]
  Backups[Tested backups] --> Data
  Logs[Logs and health monitoring] --> Synod
